*        EDIT and EDIT AND MARK: expand packed digits into a zoned pattern.
         ORG   0x1000
START    BALR  12,0
         USING *,12
         ED    PAT(6),NUM     ; length applies to the pattern
         EDMK  PAT2(6),NUM    ; source bytes are fetched on demand
         DIAG  0,0,0
PAT      DC    X'404040404040'
PAT2     DC    X'404040404040'
NUM      DC    X'01234C'
         END   START
